{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "１０月２４日。", "text_idx": 540, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "過完週末，從星期二開始要正式進入期中考試了。", "text_idx": 536, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我今天也來到瀨名同學的家打擾，按照約定請她教我念書。", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那裡錯了。要像這樣，讓這裡更有效率……」", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0496", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，原來如此……嗯，謝謝妳。」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不客氣。」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0497", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為每天都來，所以已經很習慣瀨名同學穿居家服的模樣了。", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "甚至最近還開始覺得就是這種鬆懈的感覺才好。", "text_idx": 526, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，我有盡量不用「男人」的眼光去看她就是了。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這方面是我跟櫻乃相處下來得到的結論。", "text_idx": 535, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼。」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0498", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有……只是在想我已經很習慣家裡有瓜生君在了呢。」", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0499", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然這樣說可能有點怪，不過不是習慣比較好嗎？」", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是這樣沒錯，但我心情很複雜。我為什麼會在男生面前穿成這樣呢？」", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0500", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「身為男生的我很難回答妳。」", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說……」", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0501", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此時瀨名同學抬起頭。", "text_idx": 514, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打掃地毯的時候要先灑上泡過的茶葉在掃。這是女僕的智慧喔！」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "ag0266", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「想試看看。」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 513, "voice": "sk0343", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我來了～今天也跟小紗凪一起喔！給妳，呵呵，這是小點心。」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 531, "voice": "mu0171", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然今天也有垃圾蟲存出現在學姊面前！愛理在幹嘛啊，為什麼穿成那樣教他念書？妳果然是迷上他了？」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "sn0087", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我家已經完全變成聚會場所了。」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0502", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她說的一點也沒錯……", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且今天連乾同學都來了。", "text_idx": 532, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說，乾同學那個，這樣好嗎？」", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都已經這樣了，多一個紗凪也沒什麼……唉，是誰造成的啊，讓我這樣越來越沒有底線。」", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0503", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紗凪！我想妳應該知道，要是把這件事說出去的話我可不會放過妳喔！」", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0504", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼嘛，我才不怕愛理呢。因為我跟妳認識最久了～」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "sn0088", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算知道這種事我也不會幻滅的，等著看吧！我會對所有人都保密啦～」", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "sn0089", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小紗凪的口風很緊呢。」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 531, "voice": "mu0172", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請交給我吧，美羽學姊。」", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "sn0090", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原來如此，因為乾同學的這種個性，所以還在容許範圍內啊。", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且天羽學姊的影響也很大呢。", "text_idx": 533, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以就打擾啦。」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "sn0091", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打擾了～我把點心放進冰箱裡喔～」", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 531, "voice": "mu0173", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～真是的！要坐的話拿坐墊……只有一個，所以隨便鋪個東西坐吧！」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0505", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結果今天連乾同學也加入，大家一起念書了。", "text_idx": 529, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算沒有約好，大家都主動帶課本來愛理同學的家念書了呢。」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "ag0267", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是沒有空間所以有點擠。」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 513, "voice": "sk0344", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這不是我的問題吧？不喜歡的話就立刻回去！」", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0506", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這一個星期以來不只是我，大家都會主動帶書來念。", "text_idx": 534, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當然了，有一部份的原因是瀨名同學總是會幫忙指導遇到問題的人……", "text_idx": 527, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之先集中精神１小時，知道了嗎？好……開始！」", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0507", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過瀨名同學營造出的這種認真氣氛非常關鍵。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一旦她開始率先念書，全員就不可思議地也集中精神起來。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "絕對算不上寬廣的３坪大空間中，大家肩並肩地……", "text_idx": 530, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──今天也努力用功到了日落時分。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哼嗯。」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0508", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了天羽學姊的以外，瀨名同學看了大家的筆記後用鼻子哼了一口氣。", "text_idx": 537, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看來大家都念得還不錯呢……這樣一來應該能考到不錯的分數吧。」", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0509", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的很謝謝妳，都是多虧了妳的幫忙。」", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為很努力了嘛♪」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "ag0268", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吶～」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 531, "voice": "mu0174", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 513, "voice": "sk0345", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是突然叫我念書……我明明是來玩的……」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "sn0092", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就先這樣吧，我的課外輔導結束了。」", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0510", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天後天就各自做最後衝刺。知道了嗎？」", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0511", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最後再補上一句激勵，一個星期的密集用功在此時告一段落了。", "text_idx": 511, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……真是的，簡直災難。」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0512", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不只是私底下的生活被發現，在考試前的重要時期家裡還變成大家的聚會場所……」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0513", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，真的累積了很多不順呢。」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂，你不要在那邊真的擺出很抱歉的表情啦！」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0514", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不是說過彼此彼此了嗎？我才要謝謝，那個時候受你幫助了。」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0515", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學害羞了。", "text_idx": 521, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了念書獲得的成果以外……還有種成就感。", "text_idx": 538, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好！」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接著就休息一下吧，大家都辛苦了。」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是呢，都還沒吃晚飯。」", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "ag0269", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要做點什麼嗎？」", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 513, "voice": "sk0346", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼食材都沒有……」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0516", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對了，天羽學姊帶了小點心過來吧，那就先吃那個……」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0517", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%164;「……欸！？」", "text_idx": 9, "plain": "「……欸！？」", "plain_idx": 387, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0518", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學一打開冰箱，就發出奇怪的叫聲。", "text_idx": 517, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，天羽學姊，這是……」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0519", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她拿出點心，回頭問。", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是蛋糕喔……咦？還有蠟燭。」", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 531, "voice": "mu0175", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該、該不會是知道才、今天……」「是店裡的人搞錯了嗎……」", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理／美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "go037", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大概吧。」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 531, "voice": "mu0177", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家一起看向瀨名同學。", "text_idx": 487, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔唔！」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0521", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學轉過身去背對我們。", "text_idx": 524, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該不會瀨名同學……」", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼都沒有！來休息吧！把盤子拿出來，這是今天的收尾了俐落一點！！」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0522", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……超可疑。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔。」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "sn0093", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瞭解了小紗。就是說啊就是說啊，就是那樣呢～」", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "ag0270", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以愛理同學，請用寬～大的心包容安潔的無禮吧！」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "ag0271", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔站起身，對瀨名同學恭敬地深深低下頭。", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「蛤？安、安潔妳做什麼──」", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0523", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%164;撲上！", "text_idx": 10, "plain": "撲上！", "plain_idx": 508, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀、等、欸、住手、哇啊哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！！」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0524", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;「女僕殺法搔癢之舞────！！」", "text_idx": 7, "plain": "「女僕殺法搔癢之舞────！！」", "plain_idx": 420, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "ag0272", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「住手、喂、啊啊、不行、啊、啊哈哈、啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0525", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔像鳥一樣跳起，兇猛地撲向瀨名同學對她搔癢。", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈、啊啊哈、不、呀、啊哈哈哈、不行住手啊啊、呀哈哈哈哈！」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0526", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學又笑又叫地掙扎，和平常給人的感覺差了十萬八千里。", "text_idx": 519, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拜託、住手、哈、啊啊哈、安潔快住手哈哈哈哈哈、呀、啊啊、啊啊哈哈哈哈哈！！」", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0527", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻～只要落到安潔的手中，就算是愛理同學也會回到掉根筷子都笑到不行的幼稚年紀喔～～！」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "ag0273", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不行、不行啊哈、要死、要死了、我不行、啊哈哈、啊哈哈哈！」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0528", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說吧愛理！不然安潔會這樣持續一整晚喔，大概啦！」", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "sn0094", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我知道我知道了啦說就好了吧我說就是了！啊哈哈哈哈哈住手～～～！」", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0529", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我去跟鄰居道個歉吵到他們了吧……」", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我實在不忍心看下去了……", "text_idx": 502, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天１０月２４日是瀨名同學的生日，的樣子。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……………………」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "全員", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": "go032a", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們都沉默不語。", "text_idx": 501, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又沒有什麼，那種事不用慶祝也可以，而且還在考試前，現在不是過生日的時候了……」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0530", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學嘟著嘴，滿臉通紅地碎碎念著。", "text_idx": 520, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瞞著大家或許不對，但是說出來不就像在逼你們嗎？而且我今天本來是預定一個人過的……」", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0531", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她說的或許是沒錯啦……", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……而且我跟媽媽住在一起的時候，不管什麼紀念日也都沒有慶祝……」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0532", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──原來如此。我們彼此面面相覷。這句話的震撼力不同凡響。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "為了壓抑強烈情緒的緊繃低聲。", "text_idx": 525, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我突然呼吸急促起來。", "text_idx": 504, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以我沒有特別──」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0533", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;「不管了現在立刻就慶祝吧！」", "text_idx": 6, "plain": "「不管了現在立刻就慶祝吧！」", "plain_idx": 392, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我強硬地吐出一口氣。", "text_idx": 503, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學……一臉驚訝得無以復加的表情。", "text_idx": 516, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就……預備，來！」", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;「生日快樂～～～～！！」", "text_idx": 8, "plain": "「生日快樂～～～～！！」", "plain_idx": 449, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "全員", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": "go039", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──那之後。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們泡了茶，在蛋糕上插蠟燭，簡單迅速地舉辦了生日派對。", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然也可以出門去採買一趟，打造出更熱鬧的慶祝……", "text_idx": 539, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但大家都已經忍不下去了。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0534", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "早一秒也好，想快點慶祝瀨名同學的生日。", "text_idx": 510, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──她其實很想慶祝的。這種壓抑我們都看出來了。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以早一秒也好，不讓她有時間拒絕的速度。", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那個。」", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0535", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「來～要先吹蠟燭嗎？還是先乾杯呢？選妳喜歡的就好了～～♪」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "ag0277", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不、不是──」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0536", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒問題，那個草莓是愛理的。」", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 513, "voice": "sk0349", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、那個……」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0537", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「幹嘛啦～反正是值得慶祝的日子，妳也開心一下嘛～來來來，耶！」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 528, "voice": "sn0097", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、可是……」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0538", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣小愛理也在大人的階梯往上爬一階了呢～」", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 531, "voice": "mu0180", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0539", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學漸漸地……因為不知所措和害羞，身體越縮越小。", "text_idx": 522, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像個害怕的孩子一樣。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過……」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我對瀨名同學微笑。幾乎就像反射性動作。跟剛才一樣。", "text_idx": 506, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「或許這跟瀨名同學想辦的完全不同也說不定。」", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0540", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學看著我。", "text_idx": 523, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不是。」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0541", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "呼。", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 2, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像是鬆懈了下來一般，有點奇怪的表情。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這種的、也不錯……」", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0542", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "微小不清的聲音。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我舉起杯子看著她。", "text_idx": 505, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「來。」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 509, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵。」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0543", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學不好意思地笑了，跟我一樣舉起了杯子。", "text_idx": 518, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家也笑著舉起各自的杯子輕碰。", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個……」", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0544", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 157, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………謝謝。」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ar0545", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
